# CookieYes

> Consent management platform trusted by 1.5 M+ websites. Automates cookie scanning,
> consent banners, and compliance with GDPR, CCPA, LGPD, and 30+ privacy laws.
> Part of Mozilor Technologies. Google-certified CMP and IAB TCF v2.4 registered.

