## Key Features

- Customisable cookie consent banner with geo-targeting
- Automatic cookie scanner with AI-based classification
- Consent log storage and export for audits
- Google Consent Mode v2 and IAB TCF v2.4 support
- Multilingual support (30+ languages)
- Works with WordPress, Shopify, Wix, Webflow, GTM, and more

